{"id":"n66262-1-6","stage":3,"title":"대신 · 代","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66262-1-6-1","ko":"우리 배가 별로 안 고프니까 밥 대신 간식 먹을까?","zh":"我们不太饿，要不别吃米饭，吃点零食吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"별로","meaning":"（不）怎么，（不）太","explanation":"별로 在本句与后面的 안、없다、-지 않다 等否定表达合用，合起来表示“不怎么、不太”。否定意义需要和后文一起理解。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"고프니까","meaning":"饿，饥饿","explanation":"고프다：饿，饥饿；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"고프다","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18396","senseId":"1","lemma":"고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고프니까","audio":"/audio/87d86886e985ba10d167.mp3"}},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}},{"text":"대신","meaning":"代，替，代替","explanation":"대신：代，替，代替","readings":[{"term":"대신","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66262","senseId":"1","lemma":"대신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대신","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3"}},{"text":"간식","meaning":"零食，点心","explanation":"간식：零食，点心","readings":[{"term":"간식","audio":"/audio/92eb1c6e981afb49af11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70703","senseId":"1","lemma":"간식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간식","audio":"/audio/92eb1c6e981afb49af11.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을까","audio":"/audio/5376369aa2d708aa98ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"（不）怎么，（不）太","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"（不）怎么，（不）太","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"a55fb1c7a8a68fcb","term":"고프다","zh":"饿，饥饿","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3","entryId":"18396","definition":"肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["고프다"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":[